## Project Structure
- `paper/` — Quarto source files for the paper
- `R-shiny-app-final-vesrion/` — R Shiny app source code

## Data
Data is publicly available at CSIRO Data Access Portal:
https://doi.org/10.25919/k18n-nk98

## How to Reproduce
1. Download data from the link above
2. Place data files in `paper/data/`
3. Open `paper/QTL_Analysis.qmd` in RStudio
4. Run `quarto render QTL_Analysis.qmd`

## Required R Packages
glmnet, irlba, lme4breeding, gtsummary, kableExtra, tidyverse
